// Butler County, Ohio — curated directory of meaningful links.
// Single source of truth for the app. Keep entries verified and current.
// Fields: name, category, subcategory, url, description
// Last reviewed: 2026-11-09
//
// Every URL below was fetched and its content checked against the organization
// it claims to be. Sites that block automated fetching (the ESC, both chambers
// and Oxford Township) were checked in a browser.
//
// THINGS THAT CHANGED SINCE JULY
//
//   * The Auditor's property search is Tyler iasWorld Public Access, not Pivot
//     Point / Data Dynamics; the root of propertysearch.bcohio.gov returns "page
//     not registered", so the parcel-search page is linked.
//   * jfs.bcohio.gov fails with a certificate error; the county's own JFS page is
//     used. greaterhamiltonchamber.com no longer resolves; the chamber is
//     hamilton-ohio.com.
//   * The Port Authority now operates as the Butler County Finance Authority.
//     Environmental Services is split into Water & Sewer, Recycling & Solid
//     Waste and the Storm Water District. The Area I Court moved from Oxford to
//     Hamilton; Oxford has no municipal court.
//   * Community Behavioral Health's old domain (cbh-services.org) and the Hamilton
//     Mill domain now show gambling spam; CBH is part of Community First Solutions.
//     Butler Behavioral Health's bbhs.org redirects to its new parent Best Point,
//     which has no Butler page. Sojourner Recovery is now Community Health Alliance.
//   * The Community Foundation of West Chester/Liberty is now the Northern
//     Cincinnati Foundation; the Oxford visitors bureau is Enjoy Oxford; the Miami
//     art museum is the Richard and Carole Cocks Art Museum.
//   * Butler has its own Butler County United Way, and its YMCAs belong to the
//     Great Miami Valley YMCA.
//
// TRAPS
//
//   Butler County PA/KS/MO; Liberty Township sites for other counties
//   (libertytwp.org, .us, libertytrustee.com — Butler's is liberty-township.com);
//   downtownmiddletown.com is Middletown, CONNECTICUT; Fairfield County Municipal
//   Court (Lancaster); Oxford MS/AL. Atrium Medical Center is in Warren County.
//
// GEOGRAPHY
//
//   * Seven cities (Middletown and Monroe partly in Warren; Sharonville mostly in
//     Hamilton County), villages Seven Mile, College Corner (part Preble), New
//     Miami, Millville and Jacksonburg; Somerville dissolved in 2016. Thirteen
//     townships, all with sites.
//   * Three health departments (county, Hamilton, Middletown).
//   * The Twelfth District Court of Appeals in Middletown serves eight counties.
//   * Radio licensed here: WMOH and WGRR (Hamilton), WHSS / ClassX (Hamilton),
//     WPFB Sacred Heart Radio (Middletown); WGRR's site is Cincinnati-branded.
//   * Hueston Woods State Park straddles Butler and Preble.
//
// LEFT OUT rather than listed unverified: Children Services and Development
// subdomains, the Hamilton Municipal Court site and the Village of New Miami
// (fail to load or certificate errors; county pages are used where they exist),
// Lifespan (weak source), Uptown Oxford and a Hamilton Main Street program (no
// sites found), WMUB (redirects to WVXU) and WREW (site does not identify it).

